# Markdown documentation policy
# Ignore AI-generated reports/status docs and keep only the canonical project docs.
*.md
*.MD
!README.md
!README.MD
!INSTALLATION_GUIDE.md
!BUILD_ENVIRONMENT_GUIDE.md
!RDP_API_REFERENCE.md
!docs/README.md
!docs/INSTALLATION_GUIDE.md
!docs/MODPACK_INTEGRATION_GUIDE.md
!docs/DEVELOPER_GUIDE.md

# Explicitly ignore AI/report-style markdown artifacts
*_REPORT.md
*_SUMMARY.md
*_STATUS.md
*_CHECKLIST.md
*REWORK*.md
*STAGE*.md
*PHASE*.md
*DELIVERY*.md
*IMPLEMENTATION*.md
*PRODUCTION*.md
*GRADLE*.md
